; Pins the @drumr scope to the QA Artifact Registry so this package is always
; published to (and resolved from) slingr-qa, regardless of the parent repo
; configuration. Contains no credentials: authentication is injected at publish
; time by scripts/publish.mjs through a temporary npm config file.
@drumr:registry=https://us-central1-npm.pkg.dev/slingr-qa/drumr-npm/
